 adds even more usable space, with a large recreation room that could easily become a movie room, play space, home gym or hobby area. There’s also additional cupboards, laundry and plenty of storage. Outside, you will find a mature yard that gardeners love or it could be the best play area for the kids.  It’s comfortable as it is, with plenty of opportunity to make it your own over time. Close to great schools, the City's best shopping and amenities plus the future Valley Line LRT, this homes will suit your needs for years to come. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$395,000"],["Type","House"],["Style","Bungalow"],["Bedrooms","4"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,245 sq ft"],["Lot size","6,150 sq ft"],["Year built","1966"],["Storeys","1"],["Neighbourhood","Elmwood"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T5R3N2"],["MLS® number","E4506102"],["Listed","August 29, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Washer, Dishwasher, Dryer, Freezer, Hood Fan, Window Coverings, Two Refrigerators"],["Heating","Forced air"],["Basement","Finished, Full"],["Parking","Detached Garage"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","3.9 m"],["Dining room","Main level","2.8 m"],["Kitchen","Main level","4.9 m"],["Family room","Main level","9.9 m"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.8 m"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","3.0 m"],["Bedroom 3","Main level","3.70 m × 3.00 m (12'2\" × 9'10\")"],["Bedroom 4","Basement","3.6 m"]],"courtesy":"Michelle Patterson Nipp, MaxWell Challenge Realty","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"elmwood","area":"west-edmonton"}